     "id": "9089dac07bf4abb0e268",
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Celebrate confidence, self-love and connection with a premium portrait experience from Moments in Light. </p><p>Begin with professional hair and makeup, followed by a relaxed two-hour studio photography session. </p><p>These beautiful images&nbsp;of Ivanka Zonjic shows just what’s possible – beautiful, timeless portraits that reflect personality, strength and elegance. </p><p>Each shoot includes</p><ul><li><p>studio hire</p></li><li><p>professional hair and make up</p></li><li><p>2 hours photo shoot</p></li><li><p>10 edited images with professional full skin retouching</p></li><li><p>10 beautiful 8×10 prints in a bound wallet</p></li></ul><p>See more portrait examples <a href=\"/portraits-gallery\">here</a></p><p></p><p><strong>All for just $1995</strong><br></p>",
